{"t":"AES","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"The AES Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Diversified","employees":8336,"hq":"Arlington, VA, United States","website":"https://www.aes.com","summary_en":"The AES Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a power generation and utility company. It operates through four segments: Renewables, Utilities, Energy Infrastructure, and New Energy Technologies. The company owns and/or operates power plants to generate and sell power to customers, such as utilities, industrial users, and other intermediaries; owns and/or operates utilities to generate or purchase, distribute, transmit, and sell electricity to end-user customers in the residential, commercial, industrial, and governmental sectors; and generates and sells electricity on the wholesale market, as well as investments in technologies to support leading-edge greener energy solutions. It uses various fuels and technologies to generate electricity, such as solar, hydro, wind, coal, and gas, as well as renewables comprising energy storage and landfill gas. The company owns and/or operates a generation portfolio of approximately 34,740 megawatts and distributes power to 2.7 million customers. The company operates in the United States, Chile, Dominican Republic, El Salvador, Mexico, Bulgaria, Panama, Colombia, Argentina, Vietnam, Jordan, Puerto Rico, and internationally. The company was formerly known as Applied Energy Services, Inc. and changed its name to The AES Corporation in April 2000. The AES Corporation was incorporated in 1981 and is based in Arlington, Virginia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"AES Corporation은 자회사와 함께 발전 및 유틸리티 회사로 운영됩니다. 재생 가능 에너지, 유틸리티, 에너지 인프라 및 신에너지 기술의 네 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 전력을 생산하고 전력회사, 산업 사용자, 기타 중개인과 같은 고객에게 판매하기 위해 발전소를 소유 및/또는 운영합니다. 주거, 상업, 산업 및 정부 부문의 최종 사용자 고객에게 전기를 생산, 구매, 분배, 전송 및 판매하기 위한 유틸리티를 소유 및/또는 운영합니다. 도매 시장에서 전기를 생산 및 판매하고 최첨단 친환경 에너지 솔루션을 지원하기 위한 기술에 투자합니다. 태양광, 수력, 풍력, 석탄, 가스 등 다양한 연료와 기술을 사용하여 전기를 생산하는 것은 물론 에너지 저장 및 매립 가스로 구성된 재생 에너지도 사용합니다. 이 회사는 약 34,740메가와트의 발전 포트폴리오를 소유 및/또는 운영하며 270만 명의 고객에게 전력을 공급합니다. 이 회사는 미국, 칠레, 도미니카 공화국, 엘살바도르, 멕시코, 불가리아, 파나마, 콜롬비아, 아르헨티나, 베트남, 요르단, 푸에르토리코 및 전 세계에서 운영되고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Applied Energy Services, Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 2000년 4월에 AES Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. AES Corporation은 1981년에 설립되었으며 버지니아주 알링턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":14.93,"mcap":10653520896.0,"pe":5.995984,"fpe":6.2648964,"peg":null,"ps":0.78478974,"pb":1.8650843,"ev_ebitda":11.595,"div":4.72,"beta":0.92,"hi52":17.65,"lo52":13.28},"fin":{"rev":13575000064.0,"rev_g":0.155,"eps_g":-0.144,"gross":0.21340999,"op":0.19705,"net":0.13157,"roe":0.08676,"fcf":-3240499968.0,"cash":2026000000.0,"debt":33724999680.0,"de":242.923,"eps":2.49,"feps":2.38312},"own":{"short":0.037,"inst":0.91085,"insider":0.00644},"analyst":{"n":8,"mean":15.0,"median":15.0,"high":15.0,"low":15.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.0,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":0,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":0,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":0,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":0,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-05-07","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":16.0,"priorPriceTarget":12.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-04-09","Firm":"Susquehanna","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Positive","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":15.0,"priorPriceTarget":16.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-03-26","Firm":"Argus Research","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-03-06","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":1